          "definition": "n. 儲蓄、存款、積蓄（通常以複數形出現）"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "She put part of her monthly salary into a savings account for emergencies.",
          "highlight": [
            "savings"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "她把每月薪水的一部分存入儲蓄帳戶以備不時之需。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Many families saw their savings shrink during the recent recession.",
          "highlight": [
            "savings"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "許多家庭在最近的經濟衰退中看到存款縮水。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "The bank offers a higher interest rate on long-term savings than on checking accounts.",
          "highlight": [
            "savings"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "銀行對長期存款提供的利率高於支票帳戶。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
        "reserves",
        "nest egg",
        "deposits"
      ],
      "antonyms": [
        "debt",
        "expenses"
      ],
      "phrases": [
        "savings account",
        "retirement savings",
        "national savings"
      ]
